          transliteration: 'mā no vadhīḥ varuṇa mā no hiṃsīr mā taṃ vadhīr yo naḥ priyaḥ | kṣayaṃ na indra varuṇa mṛtyor mā no dīrghāyuṣaḥ pāta ||',
