          lifeLesson: 'When you encounter different names for the same reality — different spiritual traditions, different philosophies, different perspectives — remember the Rig Veda: ekam sat vipra bahudha vadanti. The wise see the one truth behind the many expressions. The conflict is always between names, never between the reality itself. Practice seeing the one behind the many.',
          keywords: ['EkamSat', 'OneTruthManyNames', 'NonDuality', 'SymmetryBreaking'],
