          lifeLesson: 'Agni is the fire within you — the digestive fire that transforms food into energy, the mental fire that transforms confusion into clarity, the spiritual fire that transforms ignorance into wisdom. The Rig Veda begins by invoking this fire. Begin your day by kindling your inner Agni: one conscious breath, one moment of clear intention, one act of genuine effort. This is the Vedic way to begin.',
